cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NOArCO, please cite it as below and quote the input_hash / code_hash of the result record you used."
title: "NOArCO"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Open-source Python framework for pre-simulation feasibility screening of planetary-engineering,
  paraterraforming and habitat/ISRU trades: a conjunctive viability verdict with the limiting axis,
  citeable JSON records (schema noarco-result/1.1) and constants with declared provenance.
authors:
  - family-names: Malia
    given-names: Alejo
  - name: "NOArCO Contributors"
keywords:
  - terraforming
  - planetary engineering
  - feasibility screening
  - ISRU
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Terraforming Mars: Mass, Forcing, and Industrial Throughput Constraints"
    authors:
      - family-names: Turyshev
        given-names: S. G.
    year: 2026
    notes: "arXiv:2603.00402 (reference framework for the conjunctive rubric and anchors)"
